        <p><strong>Dated names:</strong> wherever this page shows <code>[TODAY'S DATE]</code>, replace it with today's date in <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code> form, without brackets. Use that same date in every P5 chat name.</p>

        <h3>Stage 01 · Brief the boundary</h3>
        <p>Before any intake gets read, you and the AI freeze what "trusted" means and what evidence will count. The boundary has to exist before the poison does — a boundary drawn after the fact is a story, not a control.</p>

        <div class="do-step">
          <p class="do-label">Confirm the vault from P4 is present:</p>
