            <li>Confirm the vault contains both <code>MOC.md</code> and <code>Morning_Brief.md</code>. If either file is missing, stop here and complete P4 first</li>
            <li>If your vault is not at the default path, copy its full path now and use it everywhere this page names <code>Documents\p4-vault</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

