            <li>Confirm the permissions control beneath the composer says <strong>Ask for approval</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="do-step">
          <p class="do-label">Now paste this into <strong>P5 — Direction — [TODAY'S DATE]</strong>, changing the vault path first if yours is different:</p>
          <pre><code>Write the P5 production spec into operator/DIRECTION_BRIEF.md. Replace the
current brief with the fields below, then set Status to LIVE. Do not interview
