            </label>
            <div class="check-detail">Both manifest receipts say PASS, every demand is checked at its target and is absent, and the hostile row's verify time is filled in. If the post-exposure check fails, keep the receipt, run the Stage 02 recovery block, record the finding, and require a clean manifest check before continuing.</div>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h3>Stage 05 · Record the controls actually used</h3>
